Traffic in Hormuz Strait slows down on Monday, data shows






                The number of commodity vessels sailing through the Strait of Hormuz totalled seven on Monday, according to Kpler data released on Tuesday.&nbsp;

This is a drop from the previous day, where eight vessel transited the strategic waterway.

